[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      4[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      5[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The library has **no** runtime options, modes, flags or `#ifdef`s
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      6[0m:[38;5;10m[49m (`grep -c '#if\|switch' c_src/src/*.c c_src/include/*.h` → 0). Its entire
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      7[0m:[38;5;10m[49m configuration surface is therefore the cross-product of *entry point* ×
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      8[0m:[38;5;10m[49m *integer size parameter* × *input value shape* × *`threshold`*, restricted to
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      9[0m:[38;5;10m[49m the combinations the code distinguishes:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     10[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **A. Entry points (both public dynamic symbols; the lower-level one is exercised
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m directly, not only through the `match` wrapper):**
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `A1` = `double spectral_contrast(float *a, float *b, int length)` — lowest-level
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   public entry point; element type `float` (see `SYMBOLS.md`).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `A2` = `int match(double *test, double *reference, int bins, double threshold)`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   — composed pipeline: `total` → gate → `preprocess`(`memcpy`+`smoothen`+
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `differentiate`+`smoothen`) ×2 → `spectral_contrast` on the *reinterpreted*
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `float` view → final compare.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **B. Size parameter, against the constants the code branches on
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m (`N_SMOOTH == 16`, `length - 1`, `length`):**
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `B0` `n = 0` — every loop degenerates.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `B1` `n = 1` — `differentiate`'s loop is skipped entirely (`i < 0`).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `B2` `n = 2` — smallest non-degenerate difference.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `B3` `2 < n < 16` — `smoothen`'s inner loop is bounded by `i + j < length`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     28[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   for **every** `i`, so *all* outputs are attenuated.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     29[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `B4` `n = 15` — last size where no window is full.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     30[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `B5` `n = 16` — exactly one full window (`i = 0` only).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     31[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `B6` `n = 17` — first size with both full and truncated windows.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     32[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `B7` `n = 31 / 32 / 33` — around `2 * N_SMOOTH`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     33[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `B8` `n` large (`64 … 4096`) — majority of windows full.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     34[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **C. Value shape. For `A2` this is doubly significant: `spectral_contrast`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     36[0m:[38;5;10m[49m re-reads the low 4 bytes of each `double`, so the *mantissa tail* of the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     37[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `double`s, not their magnitude, decides the `float` lanes.**
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     38[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `C1` uniform random positive doubles in `[0, 1)` — dense mantissas ⇒ pseudo-random
