[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     42[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `C3` exact small integers / powers of two ⇒ **low 32 mantissa bits are all
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     43[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   zero** ⇒ every `float` lane is `±0.0` ⇒ `magnitude == 0` ⇒ division by zero
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     44[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   inside `normalize` (row is the valid-input mirror of `ERRORS.md` #12).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     45[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `C4` all elements equal (constant vector) ⇒ `differentiate` yields all zeros.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     46[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `C5` `±0.0` mixture.
