[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// A `reference` vector whose `total` is **exactly** `+0.0` (pairs of `x, -x`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     36[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// summed left to right), with non-zero low mantissa halves so the `float`
