[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    214[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // the C (rows 4/5). The structurally identical zero-trip accumulator,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    215[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // `dot_product(a, b, n <= 0)`, *is* reachable and must return exactly
