I also found that [38;5;10mbins <= 0[0m [1mcrashes the C[22m: with [38;5;10mbins == 0[0m GCC's zero-length VLA leaves [38;5;10mrsp[0m unchanged, so [38;5;10mdifferentiate[0m's [38;5;10mv[length-1] = 0[0m writes [38;5;10mv[-1][0m directly onto [38;5;10mpreprocess[0m's saved return address and the library returns to address 0. That is C undefined behaviour with no value to match, so it is probed in a forked child and documented as a divergence rather than faked.[0m[0m
